---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import portrait from '../../assets/images/ronald-balutiu-portrait.jpg'

const socialLinks = [
  {
    name: 'GitHub',
    url: 'https://github.com/ronald-balutiu/',
    icon: '/assets/github-mark.svg',
  },
  {
    name: 'LinkedIn',
    url: 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/ronald-balutiu/',
    icon: '/assets/linkedin.svg',
  },
  {
    name: 'Instagram',
    url: 'https://www.instagram.com/studio.balutiu/',
    icon: '/assets/instagram.svg',
  },
  {
    name: 'Email',
    url: 'mailto:rbalutiu@gmail.com',
    icon: '/assets/email.svg',
  },
]
---

<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="intro-primary">
    <h1 id="intro-title" class="intro-title">
      <span class="intro-peace-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="intro-title-solid">Hello, I'm Ronald</span>{' '}
      <span class="intro-title-outline">Balutiu.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="intro-description">
      I’m currently a New York-based senior software engineer at <strong>Amazon Ads</strong>,
      building scalable systems that support millions of daily customers. I care deeply about clear,
      accessible user experiences where complex and critical workflows become reliable and intuitive
      to use.
    </p>
    <p class="intro-description">
      Most recently, I launched <strong>Sponsored Products for Creators</strong>, helping build
      Amazon’s creator monetization business from the ground up. The platform connects creators and
      influencers with performance advertising through a revenue-sharing model. I’ve helped design
      the platform’s architecture, expand it into new markets, and build AI tools that help creators
      identify high-earning products and automate content workflows.
    </p>
  </div>
  <figure class="intro-portrait">
    <Image
      src={portrait}
      alt="Portrait of Ronald Balutiu"
      widths={[480, 720, 960, 1200]}
      sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, min(32rem, calc(100vw - 2rem))"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      quality={85}
    />
  </figure>
  <div class="intro-about-details">
    <p>
      Before moving into advertising, I helped build <strong>Amazon Payments’</strong>{' '}
      <a
        href="https://sell.amazon.com/tools/seller-wallet"
        class="link"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Seller Wallet
      </a>{' '}
      as an early engineer, supporting its domestic and international launches. That experience
      shaped my approach to making complex financial workflows reliable and intuitive.
    </p>
    <p>
      I’m a <strong>University of Chicago</strong> alum, where my first computer science course
      sparked the interest in building software that brought me here. Outside of work I enjoy
      skiing, photography, and exploring the city I grew up in and still find endlessly interesting.
    </p>
  </div>
  <nav class="intro-social-links" aria-label="Social links">
    {socialLinks.map(({ name, url, icon }) => (
      <a
        href={url}
        target={url.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined}
        rel={url.startsWith('http') ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}
        class="intro-social-link"
      >
        <img
          src={icon}
          alt=""
          class="intro-social-icon"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
        <span>{name}</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </nav>
</section>
